          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "播放点什么，它就会显示在这里"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Play something and it shows in your notch. Hover over the notch to open the player." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Spiel etwas ab, dann erscheint es in deiner Notch. Bewege den Zeiger auf die Notch, um den Player zu öffnen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Reproduce algo y aparecerá en tu notch. Pasa el cursor sobre el notch para abrir el reproductor."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lancez une lecture et elle s’affiche dans votre notch. Survolez le notch pour ouvrir le lecteur."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Riproduci qualcosa e comparirà nel notch. Passa sul notch per aprire il player."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "何か再生すると、ノッチに表示されます。ノッチにポインタを合わせるとプレーヤーが開きます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "무언가 재생하면 노치에 표시됩니다. 노치에 포인터를 올리면 플레이어가 열립니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Reproduza algo e aparece no notch. Passe o mouse sobre o notch para abrir o player."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "播放点什么，它就会显示在刘海中。将鼠标悬停在刘海上即可展开播放器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
